OL,3,GNEWSAAnglers fear fishing ban after
OL,4,A'wildlife harmed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglers are campaigning against a
OL,7,Fpotential fishing ban on a popular
OL,8,Fboating lake in South Yorkshire.
OL,10,FCouncillors on City of Doncaster
OL,11,FCouncil insisted there was no ban in
OL,12,Fplace at Askern Lake, but warned
OL,13,Fanti-social behaviour and "harm to
OL,14,Fwildlife" must stop in order to prevent
OL,15,Fone being introduced.
OL,17,FGerald Squire, who represents the
OL,18,FNorton and Askern ward, said birds had
OL,19,Fbeen left injured by fishing lines,
OL,20,Fwith a number of geese taken away to be
OL,21,Fcared for at animal sanctuaries.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
